// Local-dev/CI stub only — avoids a 404 for index.html's <script
// src="/runtime-config.js">. The real file is generated by
// docker-entrypoint.sh (docker/runtime-config.js.template) at container
// start; this static copy under public/ is served as-is by `vite dev` and
// by the Vite preview server, and gets overwritten in dist/ at container
// runtime, never used there. Deliberately left empty (no
// window.__RUNTIME_CONFIG__ assignment) so src/lib/{gateway,api}.ts fall
// through to their Vite build-time env vars, same as before this file
// existed.
